OL,3,AAlmost 2,000 schools blockaded or
OL,4,Aclosed, says union, as protests take
OL,5,Aplace across France
OL,6,
OL,7,FStudents, parents and trade unions are
OL,8,Fdemonstrating across France, in protest
OL,9,Fat what they say is under-investment in
OL,10,Fhigh schools
OL,12,FOne union says 1,800 high schools are
OL,13,Fblockaded or closed by the government
OL,14,Ftoday, with 90% of universities also
OL,15,Fblockaded
OL,17,FIn Lille, bins have been set on fire,
OL,18,Freports Nick Beake - while a student in
OL,19,FParis tells Hugh Schofield: "I am very
OL,20,Fscared for the future"
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
