OL,3,AAlmost 2,000 schools blockaded or
OL,4,Aclosed, says union, as protests take
OL,5,Aplace across France
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn the past week, students have
OL,8,Fblockaded hundreds of schools with at
OL,9,Fleast 215 injured and more than 5,000
OL,10,Fpeople arrested
OL,12,FOn Monday, a student had his hand blown
OL,13,Foff in the city of Lens after
OL,14,Freportedly picking up a police
OL,15,Fsting-ball grenade
